            "review_title": "Review at Hoa Cau Restaurant",
            "review_text": "LitJoy\nVietnam3 contributions\n0\nNice garden view, with moon & stars\nOct 2016 • Friends\nCame here by a weekday night, with a sudden invitation from my old friends, but everything seemed to be over expectation: polite & helpful staffs, clean & friendly services, nice tastes, and amazing view: beautiful garden with a waterfall-fish lake, many trees and the high sky to deliver you \"free stars & moon\".\n\nHighly recommended & I'll be here more for sure\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 15, 2016",
